          deckDescription: 'Two standard 52-card decks combined (104 cards) plus four jokers (108 cards total). Four suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs), thirteen ranks each in duplicate. Jokers and twos are wild; used for Brazilian Buraco with canastas and team play.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (spades, hearts, diamonds, clubs) in duplicate. Sequences must be in the same suit; jokers and twos may substitute for any card. Sets are three or more of the same rank; canastas require seven cards.',
